Cell["\<\
The second Rademacher coefficient comes from either \[Omega]1,\[Omega]2,\
\[Omega]3=0,\[Pi]  and \[Omega]4=+- \[Pi]/2 plus permutations,  or
\[Omega]1,\[Omega]2,\[Omega]3=+- \[Pi]/2, \[Omega]4=0,\[Pi]  plus \
permutations.  \
\>", "Text",
