  3.995016702005587*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"03c4871e-186f-4b52-978e-\
64584e98b704"],

Cell["\<\
The fifth Rademacher comes from (\[Omega]1,\[Omega]2,\[Omega]3,\[Omega]4)=(n1\
\[Pi]/4,n2\[Pi]/4,n3\[Pi]/4,n4\[Pi]/4) with n1+n2+n3+n4 odd.  This gives 15 \
distinct choices.  We also must sum over d=-1 and d=-2.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.992525590184106*^9, 3.992525635733474*^9}, {
  3.992525690068859*^9, 3.9925257905447598`*^9}, {3.9927147667406187`*^9, 
  3.9927147889883413`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"50a9115c-759f-470f-b1f2-\
e12c864ce58b"],

